#: ../doc/effects.rst:1242
msgid "``(float, 0 to 1)`` Grain strength in dark areas of the image."
msgstr "``(float, 0 sampai 1)`` Kekuatan grain di area gelap gambar."

#: ../doc/effects.rst:1243
msgid "midtones"
msgstr "midtones"

#: ../doc/effects.rst:1243
msgid ""
"``(float, 0 to 1)`` Grain strength in middle brightness areas, such as skin "
"tones and everyday objects."
msgstr ""
"``(float, 0 sampai 1)`` Kekuatan grain di area kecerahan menengah, seperti "
"warna kulit dan objek sehari-hari."

#: ../doc/effects.rst:1244
msgid ""
"``(float, 0 to 1)`` Grain strength in bright areas, such as skies, windows, "
"and lights."
msgstr ""
"``(float, 0 sampai 1)`` Kekuatan grain di area terang, seperti langit, "
"jendela, dan lampu."

#: ../doc/effects.rst:1245
msgid "color_amount"
msgstr "color_amount"

#: ../doc/effects.rst:1245
msgid ""
"``(float, 0 to 1)`` How much the grain affects color. Lower values are "
"mostly luma grain; higher values add more chroma grain."
msgstr ""
"``(float, 0 sampai 1)`` Seberapa banyak grain memengaruhi warna. Nilai "
"rendah sebagian besar grain luma; nilai tinggi menambahkan lebih banyak "
"grain chroma."

#: ../doc/effects.rst:1246
msgid "color_variation"
msgstr "color_variation"

#: ../doc/effects.rst:1246
msgid ""
"``(float, 0 to 1)`` How independently the red, green, and blue grain "
"changes. Higher values feel more colorful and random."
msgstr ""
"``(float, 0 sampai 1)`` Seberapa independen perubahan grain merah, hijau, "
"dan biru. Nilai tinggi terasa lebih berwarna dan acak."

#: ../doc/effects.rst:1247
msgid "evolution"
msgstr "evolution"

#: ../doc/effects.rst:1247
msgid ""
"``(float, 0 to 1)`` How much the grain renews over time. Higher values make "
"the texture change more from frame to frame."
msgstr ""
"``(float, 0 sampai 1)`` Seberapa banyak grain diperbarui seiring waktu. "
"Nilai tinggi membuat tekstur berubah lebih banyak dari frame ke frame."

#: ../doc/effects.rst:1248
msgid "coherence"
msgstr "coherence"

#: ../doc/effects.rst:1248
msgid ""
"``(float, 0 to 1)`` How stable and smooth the grain remains between frames. "
"Higher values feel calmer and less jumpy."
msgstr ""
"``(float, 0 sampai 1)`` Seberapa stabil dan halus grain tetap antara frame. "
"Nilai tinggi terasa lebih tenang dan kurang lompat-lompat."

#: ../doc/effects.rst:1249
msgid "seed"
msgstr "seed"

#: ../doc/effects.rst:1249
msgid ""
"``(int, 0 to 1000000)`` Selects the exact repeatable grain pattern. Change "
"this to get a different look without changing intensity."
msgstr ""
"``(int, 0 sampai 1000000)`` Memilih pola grain yang dapat diulang secara "
"tepat. Ubah ini untuk mendapatkan tampilan berbeda tanpa mengubah "
"intensitas."

#: ../doc/effects.rst:1254
msgid ""
"Grain is easiest to judge while the video is playing, not on a single paused"
" frame."
msgstr ""
"Grain paling mudah dinilai saat video diputar, bukan pada satu frame yang "
"dijeda."

#: ../doc/effects.rst:1255
msgid ""
"If faces or bright skies look too noisy, lower ``highlights`` or ``amount``."
msgstr ""
"Jika wajah atau langit cerah terlihat terlalu berisik, turunkan "
"``highlights`` atau ``amount``."

#: ../doc/effects.rst:1256
msgid ""
"If shadows look too clean compared to the rest of the image, raise "
"``shadows`` slightly."
msgstr ""
"Jika bayangan terlihat terlalu bersih dibandingkan dengan bagian lain "
"gambar, naikkan ``shadows`` sedikit."

#: ../doc/effects.rst:1257
msgid ""
"If the grain looks too digital or sharp, raise ``softness`` or lower "
"``color_variation``."
msgstr ""
"Jika grain terlihat terlalu digital atau tajam, naikkan ``softness`` atau "
"turunkan ``color_variation``."

#: ../doc/effects.rst:1258
msgid ""
"If the grain looks too busy during motion, lower ``evolution`` or raise "
"``coherence``."
msgstr ""
"Jika butiran terlihat terlalu ramai saat bergerak, turunkan ``evolution`` "
"atau naikkan ``coherence``."

#: ../doc/effects.rst:1262
msgid ""
"The Glow effect creates a soft halo from the clip's visible pixels. It can "
"render either outside the subject for a classic outer glow, or along the "
"inside edges for an inner glow. The effect uses the source alpha channel, so"
" transparent PNGs, text, logos, and masked clips work especially well."
msgstr ""
"Efek Glow menciptakan halo lembut dari piksel yang terlihat pada klip. Efek "
"ini dapat dirender di luar subjek untuk efek glow luar klasik, atau di "
"sepanjang tepi dalam untuk glow dalam. Efek ini menggunakan saluran alfa "
"sumber, sehingga PNG transparan, teks, logo, dan klip yang dimasker bekerja "
"dengan sangat baik."

#: ../doc/effects.rst:1266
msgid ""
"You can add Glow from the :guilabel:`Effects` tab, or right-click a clip and"
" choose :guilabel:`Look → Lighting → Glow` to start with a preset: "
":guilabel:`Soft White` (a gentle neutral halo), :guilabel:`Warm` (a warm "
"amber glow), :guilabel:`Neon` (a vivid colored glow), or :guilabel:`Inner "
"Glow` (glow drawn inside the subject's edges). Presets only set the "
"properties for you; all controls remain visible and editable."
msgstr ""
"Anda dapat menambahkan Glow dari tab :guilabel:`Effects`, atau klik kanan "
"pada klip dan pilih :guilabel:`Look → Lighting → Glow` untuk memulai dengan "
"preset: :guilabel:`Soft White` (halo netral lembut), :guilabel:`Warm` (glow "
"amber hangat), :guilabel:`Neon` (glow berwarna cerah), atau :guilabel:`Inner"
" Glow` (glow yang digambar di dalam tepi subjek). Preset hanya mengatur "
"properti untuk Anda; semua kontrol tetap terlihat dan dapat diedit."

