"correct fisheye type, set **In FOV** to your lens coverage (often 180), "
"choose **Projection Mode = Sphere** or **Hemisphere**, then frame with "
"**Yaw/Pitch/Roll** and **Out FOV**."
msgstr ""
"**Ratakan klip fisheye ke tampilan normal:** Atur **Input Model** ke tipe "
"fisheye yang benar, atur **In FOV** ke cakupan lensa Anda (sering 180), "
"pilih **Projection Mode = Sphere** atau **Hemisphere**, lalu atur bingkai "
"dengan **Yaw/Pitch/Roll** dan **Out FOV**."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/effects.rst:1633
msgid ""
"**Reframe an equirect clip:** Set **Input Model = Equirectangular**, pick "
"**Sphere** (full) or **Hemisphere** (front/back). **Invert** on equirect is "
"equivalent to yaw +180 and does not mirror."
msgstr ""
"**Atur ulang bingkai klip equirect:** Atur **Input Model = "
"Equirectangular**, pilih **Sphere** (penuh) atau **Hemisphere** "
"(depan/belakang). **Invert** pada equirect setara dengan yaw +180 dan tidak "
"mencerminkan."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/effects.rst:1635
msgid ""
"**Create a fisheye output:** Choose one of the **Fisheye** projection modes "
"(2..5). **Out FOV** controls disk coverage (180 gives a classic circular "
"fisheye)."
msgstr ""
"**Buat output fisheye:** Pilih salah satu mode proyeksi **Fisheye** (2..5). "
"**Out FOV** mengontrol cakupan disk (180 memberikan fisheye melingkar "
"klasik)."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/effects.rst:1637
msgid ""
