msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Start Time` menggeser nilai hitung naik, jam, timecode, frame, "
"dan hitung mundur."

#: ../doc/effects.rst:1672
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Gravity` places the timer in one of nine positions on the frame."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Gravity` menempatkan timer di salah satu dari sembilan posisi "
"pada frame."

#: ../doc/effects.rst:1673
msgid ""
":guilabel:`X Offset (%)` and :guilabel:`Y Offset (%)` move the timer by a "
"percentage of the frame size."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`X Offset (%)` dan :guilabel:`Y Offset (%)` menggeser timer "
"berdasarkan persentase ukuran frame."

#: ../doc/effects.rst:1674
msgid ""
"Font, color, stroke, background, and opacity controls can be keyframed for "
"animated timer styles."
msgstr ""
"Kontrol font, warna, garis tepi, latar belakang, dan opasitas dapat diberi "
